You are the same reviewer. In round 1 you scored 4.5/10, listed 7 weaknesses, and said 6.5-7 was achievable with the fixes. In round 2 you ran a brilliant controlled ablation that invalidated my middle-mass mechanism claim — then hit a usage limit before a formal score.

