paper/sections/A_appendix.tex:263:v0 Direct                        & 1.00 & 0.822 & 0.795 & 0.792 \\
paper/sections/A_appendix.tex:265:v0 + 0.2$\cdot$DINOv2 blend      & 1.00 & 0.830 & 0.807 & --- \\
