benchmark/scripts/agent_prompt_v8.py:1:"""Agent v8 — Skeptical-Verification Agent (refutation-driven).
benchmark/scripts/agent_prompt_v8.py:3:Theory: the v6.5/v7 failure mode was confirmation bias — the VLM asserts a
benchmark/scripts/agent_prompt_v8.py:6:by finding it in refs. Only features that resist refutation count as
benchmark/scripts/agent_prompt_v8.py:9:Innovation claim: "Anomaly detection as refutation — every flagged feature
benchmark/scripts/agent_prompt_v8.py:11:Tool calls are explicitly framed as refutation probes, not confirmation."
benchmark/scripts/agent_prompt_v8.py:16:    - `candidate_features`: list up to 3 features that look unusual in query
benchmark/scripts/agent_prompt_v8.py:18:    - If no candidate features → anomaly impossible → final score=0.05.
benchmark/scripts/agent_prompt_v8.py:19:    - If initial_score < 0.3 AND 0 candidate features → final.
benchmark/scripts/agent_prompt_v8.py:21:      ("refutation_target") and call a tool that can show whether this
benchmark/scripts/agent_prompt_v8.py:25:    - `refutation_verdict`: did tool find the feature in refs?
benchmark/scripts/agent_prompt_v8.py:28:      * "inconclusive": can't tell; move to another feature or finalize.
benchmark/scripts/agent_prompt_v8.py:46:  tool_side_by_side(bbox=[x0,y0,x1,y1])
benchmark/scripts/agent_prompt_v8.py:55:    severity assessment, not refutation.)
benchmark/scripts/agent_prompt_v8.py:61:  tool_reference_retriever(k=4)
benchmark/scripts/agent_prompt_v8.py:65:  tool_reference_profiler()
benchmark/scripts/agent_prompt_v8.py:82:  tool_domain_knowledge(question)
benchmark/scripts/agent_prompt_v8.py:83:    Targeted text question to an LLM. May hallucinate; cross-check.
benchmark/scripts/agent_prompt_v8.py:97:You counter that bias by REQUIRING refutation probes on every suspicion.
benchmark/scripts/agent_prompt_v8.py:106:    "candidate_features": JSON list (0 to 3 items) of features that look
